{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">尖沙咀一座商業大廈收到可疑信件，警方爆炸品處理課到場處理，無人受傷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.LETTER-1230.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026RiqUddBbt71791261893.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.LETTER-1230.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">涉事的是位於堪富利士道的時財商業大廈，警員圍封大廈出入口，有警員戴上防毒面具，警方炸彈處理課人員亦到場。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.LETTER-1230_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Ed0KHwU0Eb1791261891.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.LETTER-1230_001.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方上午約9時半，接獲大廈管理處職員報案，指收到一封信件含恐嚇字句及白色粉末。據了解，信上寫著「有毒」及有骷髏頭圖案，警方鑑定證實粉末是麵粉，列作刑事恐嚇跟進調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T07:39:50.528452+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}